-- a call, then the connection ends, then another call
Hello, one
dials: 1
Hello, two
dials: 2
-- UNAVAILABLE without a retry policy is returned
UNAVAILABLE not ready
-- with 3 attempts the third call succeeds (the first call above was the first failure)
succeeded on call 3
-- an error that is not UNAVAILABLE is not retried
NOT_FOUND no such user: x
-- retries stop at the call's own deadline
DEADLINE_EXCEEDED the deadline passed
stopped near the deadline
-- keepalive: a peer that reads and never answers is noticed, and the channel is marked dead
the silent connection was closed
done
